      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Confirmed no one is seeing the notifications for vote kicks in any world I've been in.  Also, notifications in general from groups often do not appear, and should appear when logging in if they were sent at an earlier time.  World moderation tools in general need MUCH improvement, people are still sexually harassing, disrupting, spewing hateful racist comments and blocking the people who can kick them which prevents them from doing anything... so the only tool (blocking) is more beneficial to the hateful attackers than it is the people trying to stop them.",
